# SLASH-LEADING-WS on a short screen: the popup's row budget leaves the
# composer's rows past its first to the composer (inlinePickerRowBudgetCapped,
# src/ui/footer/picker_presentation.zig:793-803@481104fd, `input_extra`), and
# a draft that opens the popup can be taller than one row once a line break
# may come before its slash. The line breaks go in at the draft's start, so
# nothing is cleared between the snaps, and by Alt-Enter: C-j walks an open
# menu (routePickerControlByte). `four-all` is the bare `/` under the same
# composer: its header's range is the budget's (its count is each registry's).
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
wait 3
type /help
wait 0.6
snap one
key C-a
key M-Enter
wait 0.6
snap two
key M-Enter
key M-Enter
wait 0.6
snap four
key C-e
key BSpace BSpace BSpace BSpace
wait 0.6
snap four-all
